"linuxserver":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-zen/compare/1.24.1b-ls9...1.24.1b-ls10","upstream":"# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## Security\n- https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/advisories/mfsa2026-123/\n\n## New Features\n- Updated to Firefox 159.0.1\n- New grain options have been added to the theme picker. You can cycle through different grain effects by clicking on the circle inside the dial.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed a command prompt window briefly appearing on Windows when Zen restarts to apply an update.\n- Fixed passkey sign-in failing on websites that share passkeys across related sites, such as Facebook and Instagram.\n- Fixed crashes on Windows that could occur with some antivirus or other security software installed, in some cases also leaving WebGL disabled.\n- Fixed red and blue colors appearing swapped on some websites that use WebGL on Linux, including video call background effects.\n- More bug fixes and improvements.\n\n## Changes\n- On macOS, icons on the UI will now start using SF Symbols.\n- The 'About Zen' window has been redesigned.\n- 'My Review Request' option for Pull Requests live folder now searches for 'user-review-requested:@me' instead of 'review-requested:@me'\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/releases/tag/1.24.1b"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIE